    {
      "text": "for this cause have I raised thee up, Ex. 9:16 (Rom. 9:17). God will raise up unto thee a Prophet, Deut. 18:15 (Acts 3:22; 7:37). Lord raised up judges, Judg. 2:16. He raiseth up the poor out of the dust, 1 Sam. 2:8 (Ps. 113:7). I will raise up the decayed places, Isa. 44:26. I will raise unto David a righteous Branch, Jer. 23:5. third day he will raise us up, Hosea 6:2. In that day will I raise up the tabernacle, Amos 9:11. I will raise up a shepherd, Zech. 11:16.",
